<Layout title="About the club"><section class="page-intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow">THIS IS KU CAR CLUB</p><h1>Driven by curiosity.<br/><span class="muted">Connected by cars.</span></h1><p>Learn, Experience, Connect. Three words that bring us together.</p></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><Photo id="P04" class="about-photo"/><div class="section-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A PASSION SHARED</p><h2>There’s always<br/>more to discover.</h2><p>A beautiful design. An unexpected detail. A story behind a build. Our shared interest in cars opens the door to all kinds of conversations.</p><p>KU Car Club is where that interest becomes connection. Explore the photographs, take a look around, and join the conversation.</p><div class="about-values"><h3>Learn.</h3><p>Share a perspective. Ask a question. Discover something new.</p><h3>Experience.</h3><p>Appreciate the cars, the details, and the moments around them.</p><h3>Connect.</h3><p>Find people who share your enthusiasm.</p></div></div></div></section><JoinBlock/></Layout>
